   "title": "10. Prompt = sheet rules + scene (automatic) + product info (automatic) + look",
   "properties": {
    "Node name for S&R": "SupersideCombinePromptNode"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "Image 2 is a second sheet of the SAME product: close-ups of its controls, logo, texture and accessories - follow it for every small detail and every printed label. Image 1 is a product reference sheet: captioned panels showing the SAME product. Large panels show the whole product; small ones are close-ups for detail, not for size. Reproduce that exact product - shape, proportions, materials, controls, labels, logo. Do not copy the sheet layout, captions or white panels into the picture.",
    "",
    "",
    "The product stands the way it does in a home: square on the counter, back parallel to the wall, level, all feet down. Never rotated or tilted; the camera moves, not the product.\n\nLOOK: a real photo taken with an iPhone by someone at home, not an advert. Main phone camera (about 26 mm), handheld, slightly imperfect framing, everything in focus front to back (no blurred background), ordinary daylight from a window mixed with the room's ceiling light, natural phone colour with mild automatic HDR, a little sensor noise in the shadows, true-to-life textures, small everyday imperfections (a crumb, a cable, a slightly uneven towel). No studio lighting, no glow, no cinematic grading, no retouching, no text.\n\nNo brand names on any prop.",
    "\n\n"
   ]
  },
